WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.560 --> 00:00:04.460
Oops, I accidentally
knit a knot in this row.

2
00:00:04.490 --> 00:00:09.240
I'll rip out that row
and reset the row counter.

3
00:00:14.040 --> 00:00:18.940
Then rethread the carriage,
holding the knot below the carriage.

4
00:00:18.970 --> 00:00:24.640
When I re-knit the row,
I can now work the ends in neatly.

5
00:00:26.400 --> 00:00:30.380
This time I saw the knot
before I knitted it in.

6
00:00:30.400 --> 00:00:34.940
I'll re-thread the carriage, pulling
that knot well below the knitting.

7
00:00:34.960 --> 00:00:38.160
After knitting the row,
I'll have some generous ends to neatly

8
00:00:38.180 --> 00:00:41.320
work in and no knot
in the middle of my knitting.

